## Local tools

read, grep, glob and shell access the real files of this project. Use them to inspect the codebase.

Cloud search cannot see local files. Do not use it to explore this project.

Browser is available. For UI changes, open the running app and verify what the user sees. Do not stop at grep when they say they cannot see the change.

## Dangerous shell

Never run: git reset --hard, rm -rf, sudo, chmod 777, chown, dd, mkfs, fdisk, curl|sh, wget|sh, shutdown, reboot, poweroff, halt.

git commit and git push: git-safety.mdc (ask first). These are policy. They are not a technical sandbox.
